SUMMARY:Maker Days
LOCATION:Emerald Coast Science Center\, 31 Memorial Pkwy SW\, Fort Walton B
 each\, FL 32548
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday 10/6 · 9:00 AM to 12:00 PM\n\nMaker Days is a hands-on
  STEAM drop-off workshop at the Emerald Coast Science Center\, held the fi
 rst Monday and Tuesday of every month. October's lesson\, Blueprints of th
 e Wild\, covers animal engineering and biomimicry. It costs $35 for member
 s and $40 for nonmembers\, with $10 off each additional sibling\, and a sp
 ot isn't confirmed until you pay.\n\nPrice: from $40\n\nDetails: https://c
 oastaleventures.com/events/ev-maker-days-1006.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-maker-days-1006.html
CATEGORIES:STEM and learning
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
